      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Would like to leave a comment here for a bump, plus new information.\n\nThere are few times this year that I had tried to use Elite XR controllers and bindings do not outright work anymore using \"Quest-compatibility\" bindings. Touch signals do not register anymore in VRChat as opposed to last year. Hand gestures won't work this way, unless I map the Vive Wand-like bindings on the analog stick and pressing down to move or rotate.\n\nI only have Index knuckles as an alternative and I can't use that anymore due to having recently moved and the setting is not ideal for the base stations... VR controllers can be pretty expensive to invest in. Would love to see this fixed ASAP.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
